<title>INDIA: India 96/97 oilseeds output seen at 24.11 mln t.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 oilseeds output seen at 24.11 mln t.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian oilseeds production is estimated to rise to 24.11 million tonnes in 1996/97 (June-May) from 22.42 million in the previous period, the Agriculture Ministry said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
